<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/"><channel><title>架构思考 on Yune's blog</title><link>https://blog.suyuri.com/tags/%E6%9E%B6%E6%9E%84%E6%80%9D%E8%80%83/</link><description>Recent content in 架构思考 on Yune's blog</description><generator>Hugo -- 0.168.0</generator><language>zh-cn</language><lastBuildDate>Thu, 15 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://blog.suyuri.com/tags/%E6%9E%B6%E6%9E%84%E6%80%9D%E8%80%83/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>大模型的“遥控器”到底长啥样？从一次企业邮箱 MCP 维修聊聊协议本质</title><link>https://blog.suyuri.com/posts/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E7%9A%84%E9%81%A5%E6%8E%A7%E5%99%A8%E5%88%B0%E5%BA%95%E9%95%BF%E5%95%A5%E6%A0%B7%E4%BB%8E%E4%B8%80%E6%AC%A1%E4%BC%81%E4%B8%9A%E9%82%AE%E7%AE%B1-mcp-%E7%BB%B4%E4%BF%AE%E8%81%8A%E8%81%8A%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E6%9C%AC%E8%B4%A8/</link><pubDate>Thu, 15 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://blog.suyuri.com/posts/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E7%9A%84%E9%81%A5%E6%8E%A7%E5%99%A8%E5%88%B0%E5%BA%95%E9%95%BF%E5%95%A5%E6%A0%B7%E4%BB%8E%E4%B8%80%E6%AC%A1%E4%BC%81%E4%B8%9A%E9%82%AE%E7%AE%B1-mcp-%E7%BB%B4%E4%BF%AE%E8%81%8A%E8%81%8A%E5%8D%8F%E8%AE%AE%E6%9C%AC%E8%B4%A8/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;现在的 AI Agent（智能体）用起来越来越像个无所不能的赛博管家：不仅能陪你聊天写代码，还能帮你查收邮件、运维服务器、甚至整理本地笔记。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;很多人以为，这是大模型“成精”了，自己学会了操作电脑。但冷静一想：&lt;strong&gt;大模型本质上只是一个在概率空间里预测下一个字概率的计算模型，它既没有手脚，也不通网线，更不可能直接理解什么 IMAP 协议、Linux Socket 或是特定的业务数据库。&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>